Date: Tue, 10 Feb 2026 02:58:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Full iOS app redesign: premium web-synced design system

- Theme: Fix silver, add semantic colors, gold shadows, accent shades
- Tab bar: Gold active tint, silver inactive, polished dot indicator
- Login: Dark charcoal gradient hero, feature chips, gold CTA
- Dashboard: Portfolio hero card, bar chart, process tracker, quick actions
- Properties: Summary badges, hot opportunities, lifecycle dots, 3-column stats
- Financials: Income/expense bar chart, progress ring, filter tabs
- Agent: Level system, earnings chart, referral pipeline, client cards
- Profile: 3-stat row, role badge, gold accent menus, logout button
- Simulator: Charcoal result card, gold icons, fixed text visibility
- Fix broken color tokens across chat, modals, stat blocks

